{
  "statement": "Security and privacy are essential for a bookkeeping system to protect sensitive financial data and ensure user trust. My requirements guarantee data encryption during transmission and storage (TRU-01), implement role-based access control (TRU-02), and maintain an immutable audit trail (TRU-03) for accountability. Validating data input (TRU-04) prevents unauthorized entries, while two-factor authentication (TRU-05) adds an extra layer of security. Logging user access (TRU-06) ensures transparency, and restricting data access to relevant users (TRU-07) enhances privacy. Together, these requirements create a robust security framework critical for user confidence in the system.",
